      "message": "test(sim): plunge_depth_tab pins the pecked tab window dives\n\nPR #3866 (#3678) made each tab window dive of the 2d/contour-tabs case\npeck one stepdown at a time, and merged before PR #3847 (#3679), whose\ntest pinned the three dives that the verifier named. Main went red.\n\nThe test now pins that the verifier names no PlungeTooDeep finding, and\nthat tab windows 1 to 3 each peck Z4, Z2, Z0 with no feed more than the\n2 mm stepdown below the depth before it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nFixes #3920",
